        "text": "=Hi {{ $json.Name }}, we noticed some difficult things in your recent check-ins. You do not have to deal with this alone. In the Netherlands you can call 113 Zelfmoordpreventie free of charge, 24/7, on 113 or 0800-0113. You can also speak to your GP, a therapist, or someone you trust. This message was generated automatically and is not a diagnosis — please reach out to a real person.",
